### Exemplo de webhook (recebido pelo teu servidor)
POST https://teusistema.ao/api/webhooks/pagamentos
Content-Type: application/json
X-Signature: {{assinatura-do-fornecedor}}

{
  "event": "payment.confirmed",
  "data": {
    "reference": "ABC123456",
    "amount": 11499,
    "currency": "AOA",
    "paid_at": "2025-08-27T12:00:00Z"
  }
}
